<title>NEW ZEALAND: St Lukes sets NZ$1.572 div strike price.</title>
<headline>St Lukes sets NZ$1.572 div strike price.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Lukes Group Ltd on Wednesday said the strike price for shares in lieu of cash dividend for payment on November 5, 1996, was NZ$1.572.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
